Other uses have already been mentioned.  Sometimes a
statue is a trap that turns into a monster when you enter
its location.

One semi-obvious use of statues - The Oracle level has
several statues.  The Oracle level is close to the enterance
to Sokoban.  Sometimes there's a monster blocking the
path you want to push a boulder to solve that level.
Breaking a statue gives rocks.  Rocks can be thrown
past boulders to kill monsters.  It all adds up as if it was
planned that way.

