Boxes are less heavy than chests.  Iceboxes are more
heavy than chests.  If you want to be deliberately
Burdened, they be do that for you.  Drop one item and
go from Durdened to not.  Pretty much useless except
to know what to drop first when entering combat.

> 3) I displaced my little dog. Did that hurt him at all? Did it do
> anything at all? Make it less tame? Anything?

Displacing into a trap can make him less tame.  There
exist types of traps that might be worth the effort.
Otherwise the message is one of those standards of
Nethack - There are lots of messages that you eventually
learn aren't interesting.  Brushing through lots of
uninteresting messages risks missing that one "Your
feel healthy" or whatever that is filled with meaning.


